{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m63pvfwayk2a","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","uri":"at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m63pvfwayk2a","cid":"bafyreie4vxbphavx2eyx3m7i3slq2bm5l5ejcyrusrfwee23jhvksfajpe","auteur_did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/agenetet.bsky.social/post/3m63pvfwayk2a","date":"2025-11-20T21:34:37.699Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-11-20T21:34:38.537Z","text":"L'École a su s’organiser et se réformer pour instaurer un dialogue clair et ouvert avec les parents.\n \nTout est fait pour que les faits inacceptables qui ont pu se produire ne se reproduisent jamais.\n\nLes décisions de l’École doivent, en revanche, être respectées par tous.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Az7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreifrwcpg44uongktq3f3rieylco4wfvwaodgn6dcsy34ljhrwaipxq/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m63lki2xbs2m","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","uri":"at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m63lki2xbs2m","cid":"bafyreifbw5xbkttbiojktmotzygdhsttdf45fly5dblt5iu64e5leifkw4","auteur_did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/agenetet.bsky.social/post/3m63lki2xbs2m","date":"2025-11-20T20:16:55.884Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-11-20T20:16:56.532Z","text":"L'École de la République est mixte, elle est universelle.\n\nElle ne doit subir aucune pression, d'aucune sorte.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Az7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreicjojylyd7m7eui7tizeh6eq7gbgv67skqqvnhybrdc7izp3nrpqm/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m63jqqqvuk2x","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","uri":"at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m63jqqqvuk2x","cid":"bafyreif5bv52xvzp5cys4aqipum5sb4ufllqnflb7e35h5srd5h4ju5vee","auteur_did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/agenetet.bsky.social/post/3m63jqqqvuk2x","date":"2025-11-20T19:44:38.835Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-11-20T19:44:40.736Z","text":"À Rennes, un enseignant, directeur d’école maternelle, a été menacé de mort : je lui apporte tout mon soutien. \n\nTrop d’enseignants voient aujourd’hui leurs enseignements remis en cause et leur autorité compromise.\n\nL’École, une et indivisible, ne peut être contestée.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Az7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreigq7d2jscwphneqliq54nyuxwkf6s7ua2z7gkvn5ed3hwmuyav46q/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
